# ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Precision Core Builders — Environment Variable Template
# ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Copy this file to .env.local for local development
# Add all values to Netlify dashboard for production deployment
# ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── Required for Basic Operation ─────────────────────────────

# Supabase (Database + Auth + Storage)
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres:[your-password]@db.[project-ref].supabase.co:5432/postgres
SUPABASE_URL=https://[your-project-ref].supabase.co
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJ... (get from Supabase dashboard → Settings → API)
SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=eyJ... (get from Supabase dashboard → Settings → API)

# Client-side Supabase (VITE_ prefix makes them available in browser)
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://[your-project-ref].supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=eyJ... (same as SUPABASE_ANON_KEY above)

# AI — Anthropic Claude (All AI features use this)
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-... (get from console.anthropic.com)

# AI — OpenAI Whisper (Voice transcription only)
OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-... (get from platform.openai.com)

# Weather API (Smart scheduling feature)
OPENWEATHERMAP_API_KEY=... (get free key from openweathermap.org/api)

# Application Environment
NODE_ENV=development

# ── Optional: Advanced Features ──────────────────────────────

# Stripe (Milestone billing & payment links)
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_... (development) or sk_live_... (production)
STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_... (development) or pk_live_... (production)
VITE_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_... (same as STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY)

# n8n Automation (Sub-contractor notifications, lead routing)
N8N_WEBHOOK_URL=https://your-n8n-instance.com/webhook/...
N8N_API_KEY=... (if using authenticated n8n webhooks)

# Admin Setup Token (Change this from default!)
ADMIN_TOKEN=your-secure-random-token-here

# ── For Production Only ──────────────────────────────────────

# Custom Domain (Set in Netlify dashboard, not here)
# precisioncorebuilders.com

# ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Setup Instructions
# ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# 1. Local Development:
#    - Copy this file: cp .env.template .env.local
#    - Fill in all values marked with [...]
#    - Run: pnpm dev
#
# 2. Netlify Production:
#    - Go to: Netlify dashboard → Site settings → Environment variables
#    - Add each variable above (except VITE_* are auto-derived)
#    - Redeploy site
#
# 3. Database Setup:
#    - Run: ./scripts/setup-database.sh --seed-demo
#    - This creates all 12 tables + RLS policies
#
# 4. Create Admin User:
#    - Go to Supabase dashboard → Authentication → Users
#    - Create user with your email
#    - In SQL editor: UPDATE users SET role = 'admin' WHERE email = 'your@email.com';
#
# 5. Test Deployment:
#    - curl https://your-site.netlify.app/api/platform-health?adminToken=...
#    - Visit https://your-site.netlify.app/admin
#    - Log in and test features
#
# For detailed instructions, see: DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md
# ═════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
